    {
      "id": "cloudManager-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 25,
      "strokeColor": "#003d80",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "cloudManager.ts",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "fontStyle": "bold"
    },
    {
      "id": "cloudManager-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 255,
      "height": 150,
      "strokeColor": "#003d80",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "Module singleton, keyed by mac\n\n• load() → GET /api/devices/:mac\n  → setZones() authoritative\n• startSSE() → EventSource\n  /api/devices/:mac/stream\n• pollStatus() every 10s\n• applyZoneUpdate()\n  guards pending→idle\n• state: {connecting, connected}\n• subscribers: Set<fn>",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },

    {
      "id": "bleManager",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "#ede9fe",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "bleManager-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 390,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 25,
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "bleManager.ts",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "fontStyle": "bold"
    },
    {
      "id": "bleManager-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 395,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 255,
      "height": 170,
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "Module singleton, keyed by controllerId\n\n• doConnect() → BLE connect\n• subscribeToZoneData() B3 notify\n  → guarded by initialFetchDone\n  → setZones() + syncQueue()\n• get_zones after connect\n  → setZones() authoritative\n  → sets initialFetchDone=true\n• retry on disconnect (max 10)\n• state: {connecting, connected}\n• subscribers: Set<fn>",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },

    {
      "id": "controllerStore",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2e7d32",
      "backgroundColor": "#e8f5e9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "controllerStore-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 710,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 25,
      "strokeColor": "#1b5e20",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "controllerStore.ts",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "fontStyle": "bold"
    },
    {
      "id": "controllerStore-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 715,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 275,
      "height": 210,
      "strokeColor": "#1b5e20",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "Module singleton\ncache: Map<storeKey, ZoneData[]>\nqueue: Map<storeKey, zoneId[]>\n\nBLE key  = controllerId (UUID)\nCloud key = mac\n\n• setZones(key, zones[]) — full replace\n• patch(key, zoneId, status, runtime)\n• seed(key, zones[]) — no-op if exists\n• syncQueue(key) — remove non-pending\n• enqueue(key, zoneId)\n• dequeue(key, zoneId)\n• queuePosition(key, zoneId)\n• subscribe(key, fn) → unsubscribe fn\n• single setInterval tick — counts\n  down running zones, flips→idle",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },

