      "text": "cloudManager.start(mac)  [idempotent]\nsubscribeState → [connecting, connected]\nsubscribeStatus → [status]\ncontrollerStore.subscribe(mac) → [zones]\n\nprovides via Ctx:\n  storeKey = mac\n  execCommand → API calls\n  setZones → controllerStore.setZones(mac)",
