      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "bleManager.start(id, deviceId, sub)  [idempotent]\nsubscribeState → [connecting, connected]\nsubscribeStatus → [status]\ncontrollerStore.subscribe(id) → [zones]\n\nprovides via Ctx:\n  storeKey = controllerId\n  execCommand → bleManager.execCommand()\n  setZones → controllerStore.setZones(id)",
